<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>बाबा योगीराज क्लब</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:system-ui;background:#fff8e8}
nav{background:#4a0a0a;color:#ffd88a;padding:10px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold}
.top{text-align:center;background:#fff;padding:20px 10px}
.top img{width:175px;height:175px;border-radius:50%;border:4px solid #7a0000;object-fit:cover}
.poster img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.box{max-width:800px;margin:auto;padding:12px}
.card{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1);margin-bottom:12px}
.gallery img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:14px;display:block;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>बाबा योगीराज क्लब, चियांकी - 822102</nav>
<div class="top">
<img src="logo.jpg?v=2" alt="logo">
<h3 style="color:#4a0a0a;margin-top:10px">बाबा योगीराज क्लब, चियांकी</h3>
</div>
<div class="poster">
<img src="puja-poster.jpg?v=2" alt="poster">
</div>
<div class="box">
<div class="card">जय बाबा योगीराज! सेवा • संस्कृति • संगठन</div>
<div class="gallery">
<img src="IMG-20260925-WA0033.jpg?v=2">
<img src="IMG-20260922-WA8504.jpg?v=2">
<img src="IMG-20260905-WA0011.jpg?v=2">
<img src="IMG-20260501-WA0008.jpg?v=2">
<img src="IMG-20260501-WA0009.jpg?v=2">
<img src="FB_IMG_1790343236325.jpg?v=2">
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
